    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Splitfire Mechanic</strong> - Aim weapons in two directions at once. Double weapons + double control = double action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Retro Evolution</strong> - Evolves the twin-stick shooter in the grand tradition of classics like Geometry Wars, Robotron 2084, Centipede, Galaga, and Asteroids. This is the re-invention of the classic shooter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Color-Coded Combat</strong> \u2013 Strategically match weapons to enemies by color for maximum effectiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Suspenseful Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 An epic soundtrack inspired by games like Halo and Mass Effect.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd2b\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Splitfire Mechanic</strong> - Aim weapons in two directions at once. Double weapons + double control = double action.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Retro Evolution</strong> - Evolves the twin-stick shooter in the grand tradition of classics like Geometry Wars, Robotron 2084, Centipede, Galaga, and Asteroids. This is the re-invention of the classic shooter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udd34\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Color-Coded Combat</strong> \u2013 Strategically match weapons to enemies by color for maximum effectiveness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb8 <strong>Suspenseful Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 An epic soundtrack inspired by games like Halo and Mass Effect.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Splitfire is the homage to classic twin-stick shooters like Geometry Wars, that evolves the genre by answering the question, 'What if both thumbsticks controlled their own weapons?'.",
